{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"权"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"权"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"表示论","text":"表示论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>Lie 群或代数群</h3>\n<p>Lie 群或代数群的<strong>权</strong> (weight) 就是其"},{"Local":{"url":"极大环面","text":"极大环面"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"特征","text":"特征"}},{"Plain":". 权构成的 Abel 群称为<strong>权格</strong> (weight lattice), 记为\n$$\r\nX^*(T) := \\operatorname{Hom}(T,\\mathbb G_m).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>对于固定的"},{"Local":{"url":"根","text":"正根系"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta_+$, <strong>支配权</strong> (dominant weight) 是和每个 $\\alpha\\in\\Delta_+$ 配对都非负的权.</p>\n<h3>Lie 代数</h3>\n<p>Lie 代数的权是其 "},{"Local":{"url":"Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan 子代数"}},{"Plain":"上的线性函数, 即 $\\mathfrak{h}^*$ 的元素.</p>\n<p>设 $V$ 是 Lie 代数 $\\mathfrak g$ 的表示, $\\lambda$ 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan 子代数"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak h$ 上的线性函数.定义 $V$ 关于权 $\\lambda$ 的<strong>权空间</strong>为\n$$\r\nV_\\lambda = \\{ v\\in V \\colon  \\forall H\\in \\mathfrak h, Hv=\\lambda (H) v\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>特别地, 若 $V$ 是 $\\mathfrak g$ 的伴随表示, 此时具有非平凡权空间的权称为"},{"Local":{"url":"根","text":"根"}},{"Plain":" (root).</p>\n"}]}}